<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Sometimes we are pleased that He remains.</l><l>We love Him and cherish Him, yet there</l><l>Are times that we secretly wish He’d go.</l><l>This One, however our Christ we could</l><l>Never escape or evade.</l><l>Though we would tell Him to just go away</l><l>And to leave us alone,</l><l>Jesus won’t leave.</l><l>It is impossible to be alone.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>We’re single no more; now we are two.</l><l>Formerly we were just one by</l><l>Ourselves, but now Christ wants to be our life.</l><l>Once we got saved we could never again</l><l>Be alone by ourselves;</l><l>Someone has come, now wherever we go</l><l>And whatever we do,</l><l>Jesus is here.</l><l>Always this other Person stays with us.</l><l>He is our life.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
